      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHEZ SWEET LOUISE NZ (3) drew wide last start and was far from disgraced when beaten 8.5 metres into fifth in stronger company at Menangle. Came from wider than this to place here prior. Should get her chance from the good draw. HUNTER SHANNON (1) put the writing on the wall when he went back from a wide barrier but worked home well for second here last week. Race fit now and should get his chance from the inside draw. BETTING RANGER (4) is building in fitness and could be ready to peak after back-to-back placings here, going under by just a head last time. BEACHRIDE (5) switches from Queensland to the Bernie Hewitt yard where he was a Redcliffe winner two back. Has won at this circuit and distance twice before so could measure up.",
